      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What the receiver establishes",
      "items": [
        "A correlated implicit main-file first-page read, or healthy complete none, within the declared catalog.",
        "Client-selected model is persisted; backend identity, all pages and semantic adherence are not verified."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Finalization and timing",
      "items": [
        "Cleanup and complete transport drain precede routing and finalized observations; the receipt must match.",
        "monotonic_ns measures controller setup, task and cleanup, not provider latency. Missing timing stays unknown."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Implementation is not qualification",
      "items": [
        "Changed-source native qualification is pending. Current offline CLI evidence uses fake qualifications and native journals.",
